# Kalshi API Token Configuration

# To use real Kalshi API integration, you need to:
# 1. Get your API token from Kalshi
# 2. Set it as an environment variable: export KALSHI_API_TOKEN="your_token_here"
# 3. Or create a file: echo "your_token_here" > config/kalshi_api_token.txt

# Example token (replace with your actual token):
# KALSHI_API_TOKEN=your_actual_kalshi_api_token_here
